@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@accessToken = paste_access_token_here
@refreshToken = paste_refresh_token_here

### Регистрация пользователя
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "new_user",
  "password": "secret",
  "email": "new_user@example.com"
}

### Логин
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "me",
  "password": "pass"
}

### Обновление access token по refresh token
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/auth
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh_token": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Проверка heartbeat
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/heartbeat
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Получить категории
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Создать категорию
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Work",
  "color": "#4F46E5"
}

### Частично обновить категорию
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/category_id
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated category",
  "color": "#0EA5E9"
}

### Удалить категорию
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/category_id
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
